  "description": "A lazy-loading Windows-Explorer-style TreeView control for WinUI 3 / Windows App SDK.\n      Features filesystem provider with hidden/system folder support (dimmed opacity),\n      virtual provider for ZIP archives and FTP listings, programmatic path reveal,\n      integrated search/filter, custom icons, and tooltips.\n      Implement ITreeNodeProvider to connect any data source.\n      Requires Windows App SDK 1.8+ runtime.",
